{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30740","headline":"浊水求珠 · 项斯","name":"浊水求珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵魄自沉浮，从来任浊流。\n愿从深处得，不向暗中投。\n圆月时堪惜，沧波路可求。\n沙寻龙窟远，泥访蚌津幽。\n是宝终知贵，唯恩且用酬。\n如能在公掌，的不负明眸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}